<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>
    <h2>Hello <%= name %>,</h2>
    <p>Thank you for registering with GridWatch.</p>
    <p>Your one-time password (OTP) for verifying your email is:</p>
    <h1 style="letter-spacing: 5px; color: #4A90E2;"><%= otp %></h1>
    <p>This OTP will expire in <%= expirationMinutes %> minutes.</p>
    <p>If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>
